  "passageHtml": "<h2>READING PASSAGE 3</h2><h3>The Globemakers</h3><p>In 2008, Peter Bellerby... <span class='hl' id='hl-q27' data-q='[Q27]'>triggered an almost obsessive, decade-long journey, marked by a series of obstacles</span>.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q29' data-q='[Q29]'>obtaining such a globe was not simply a matter of a quick online order</span>... <span class='hl' id='hl-q33' data-q='[Q33]'>contrary to stubbornly held popular views of our ancestors' geographical ignorance, we have known that the world is spherical since 6th century BCE</span>. <span class='hl' id='hl-q34' data-q='[Q34-NG]'>Plato likened it to a leather ball</span>... <span class='hl' id='hl-q35' data-q='[Q35-NG]'>Crates of Mallus made one in 150 BCE</span>. <span class='hl' id='hl-q36' data-q='[Q36]'>Surely, Bellerby reasoned, a good-quality globe wouldn't be difficult to find</span>.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q30-31' data-q='[Q30-31]'>Bellerby came across <span class='kw'>shoddy commercial versions</span> designed for <span class='kw'>school classrooms</span></span>... <span class='hl' id='hl-q32' data-q='[Q32]'>trips to Morocco and India, where <span class='kw'>knowledge of artisan cartographers had been preserved</span>, drew a blank</span>.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q28' data-q='[Q28]'>almost everything that could possibly go wrong did so</span>.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q37' data-q='[Q37]'>Right at the end of the process, he learnt that the paper had stretched slightly</span>.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q38' data-q='[Q38]'>Bellerby clearly found a <span class='kw'>kindred spirit in Martin Behaim</span>... reflected in even more <span class='kw'>heroic efforts of Vincenzo Coronelli</span></span>.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q39' data-q='[Q39]'>Bellerby's book is also a lament for the fading away of centuries-old traditions</span>.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q40' data-q='[Q40]'>His book... <span class='kw'>is hardly a blueprint for commercial success</span></span>.</p>",
  "questionHtml": "<div class='section-title'>Questions 27-32</div><div class='question' id='q27'>an unexpectedly <b>27.</b> <input type='text' id='q27_input' class='fill-input' maxlength='2'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> G (challenging task)</div></div><div class='question' id='q28'>overcome <b>28.</b> <input type='text' id='q28_input' class='fill-input' maxlength='2'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> J (numerous problems)</div></div><div class='question' id='q29'>straightforward <b>29.</b> <input type='text' id='q29_input' class='fill-input' maxlength='2'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> I (internet purchase)</div></div><div class='question' id='q30'>Some <b>30.</b> <input type='text' id='q30_input' class='fill-input' maxlength='2'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> C (inferior makes)</div></div><div class='question' id='q31'>intended for <b>31.</b> <input type='text' id='q31_input' class='fill-input' maxlength='2'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> A (educational use)</div></div><div class='question' id='q32'>have the <b>32.</b> <input type='text' id='q32_input' class='fill-input' maxlength='2'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> E (necessary skills)</div></div><div class='section-title'>Questions 33-36</div><div class='question' id='q33'><p><b>33.</b> Assumption that people knew very little about geography is correct.</p><div class='options'><label><input type='radio' name='q33' value='YES'> YES</label><label><input type='radio' name='q33' value='NO'> NO</label><label><input type='radio' name='q33' value='NOT GIVEN'> NOT GIVEN</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> NO</div></div><div class='question' id='q34'><p><b>34.</b> Plato criticised for saying world shaped like leather ball.</p><div class='options'><label><input type='radio' name='q34' value='YES'> YES</label><label><input type='radio' name='q34' value='NO'> NO</label><label><input type='radio' name='q34' value='NOT GIVEN'> NOT GIVEN</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> NOT GIVEN</div></div><div class='question' id='q35'><p><b>35.</b> Globe made by Crates of Mallus was accurate representation.</p><div class='options'><label><input type='radio' name='q35' value='YES'> YES</label><label><input type='radio' name='q35' value='NO'> NO</label><label><input type='radio' name='q35' value='NOT GIVEN'> NOT GIVEN</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> NOT GIVEN</div></div><div class='question' id='q36'><p><b>36.</b> Bellerby assumed few problems locating well-made globe.</p><div class='options'><label><input type='radio' name='q36' value='YES'> YES</label><label><input type='radio' name='q36' value='NO'> NO</label><label><input type='radio' name='q36' value='NOT GIVEN'> NOT GIVEN</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> YES</div></div><div class='section-title'>Questions 37-40</div><div class='question' id='q37'><p><b>37.</b> Attempts to attach gores: <b>B.</b> became aware of unexpected issue</p><div class='options-vertical'><label><input type='radio' name='q37' value='A'> A</label><label><input type='radio' name='q37' value='B'> B</label><label><input type='radio' name='q37' value='C'> C</label><label><input type='radio' name='q37' value='D'> D</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> B</div></div><div class='question' id='q38'><p><b>38.</b> Mentioning past makers: <b>C.</b> had something in common with each</p><div class='options-vertical'><label><input type='radio' name='q38' value='A'> A</label><label><input type='radio' name='q38' value='B'> B</label><label><input type='radio' name='q38' value='C'> C</label><label><input type='radio' name='q38' value='D'> D</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> C</div></div><div class='question' id='q39'><p><b>39.</b> Main point in paragraph 7: <b>D.</b> regrets loss of traditional skills</p><div class='options-vertical'><label><input type='radio' name='q39' value='A'> A</label><label><input type='radio' name='q39' value='B'> B</label><label><input type='radio' name='q39' value='C'> C</label><label><input type='radio' name='q39' value='D'> D</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> D</div></div><div class='question' id='q40'><p><b>40.</b> Comment about book: <b>A.</b> does not tell how to create profitable business</p><div class='options-vertical'><label><input type='radio' name='q40' value='A'> A</label><label><input type='radio' name='q40' value='B'> B</label><label><input type='radio' name='q40' value='C'> C</label><label><input type='radio' name='q40' value='D'> D</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> A</div></div><button class='btn-submit' onclick='checkAnswers()'>CHẤM BÀI VÀ NỘP KẾT QUẢ</button>"
